    {
      "id": "ipc",
      "title": "IPC across the boundary",
      "deck": "Round trips from the frontend to the host and back at 1 KB, 64 KB, 1 MB, 16 MB, on each shell's idiomatic JSON path and on its raw bytes path, plus host-to-frontend push at 1000 events per second. The chart is the idiomatic 1 MB round trip; the headline is the geometric mean over the idiomatic sizes.",
